91	     * the fixed city-to-region table (including a {@code null} city).
92	     *
93	     * @param city the owner's stored city, or {@code null}
94	     * @return the canonical region string, or {@code "UNKNOWN"} when the city is not in the table
95	     */
96	    public static String forCity(String city) {
